      {
        "id": 17678,
        "title": "Bu",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 149898,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Yeni bir oyun nesnesi özelliği oluşturmadan önce özel bir anahtar kelimeye ihtiyacımız var: <code>this</code>. Oluşturulmakta olan nesneye başvurmak için <code>this</code> anahtar kelimesini ekleriz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name, health) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"50\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>this</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 149899,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Yeni bir oyun nesnesi özelliği oluşturmak için <code>this</code> anahtar kelimesini, ardından nokta ve özellik adı gelecek şekilde kullanmamız gerekir.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name, health) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"50\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"51\" /><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"55\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>this</code>, ardından <code>.</code> ve son olarak <code>name</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 149900,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Yeni oyun nesnesi özelliğini oluşturmayı tamamlamak için <code>name</code> parametresini <code>this.name</code> değerine atayacağız.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name, health) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health = health;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"57\" /><option startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"62\" /><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"63\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>=</code>, ardından <code>name</code> ve son olarak <code>;</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 149901,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sınıfımızı kullanma zamanı. Bir sabit oluştururken yaptığımız gibi başlıyoruz, ancak ardından <code>new</code> anahtar sözcüğünü ve sonrasında <code>Player()</code> ifadesini ekliyoruz.</p><p>Burada <code>new Player()</code> değerini <code>player1</code> sabitine atayacağız.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name, health) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health = health;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player1 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Player();\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"116\" endIndex=\"119\" /><option startIndex=\"120\" endIndex=\"126\" /><option startIndex=\"126\" endIndex=\"128\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>new</code>, ardından <code>Player</code> ve son olarak <code>()</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 149902,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ardından, yeni oyuncu için ayarlamak istediğimiz değerleri parantezlerin içine ekleyebiliriz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name, health) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health = health;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player1 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Player(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Aria&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(player1);\" /></content></code></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 149903,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>İşte oldu! Artık çok daha az kodla istediğimiz kadar oyuncuyu kolayca oluşturmak için sınıfları kullanabiliriz.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name, health) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health = health;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player1 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Player(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Aria&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player2 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Player(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Blaze&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"80\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(player1);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(player2);\" /></content></code></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 149904,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Şu anda oluşturduğumuz oyun nesnesine başvurduğumuzu koda belirtmek için bir sınıfta hangi anahtar kelimeyi belirtmemiz gerekir?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>this</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>new</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>class</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>this</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 149905,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir sınıfın <code>score</code> özelliği var. Sınıfın içindeyken bu özelliğe nasıl erişiriz?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>this.score</code> ile</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>this(score)</code> ile</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>this.score</code> ile.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 149906,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Yeni bir <code>Enemy</code> nesnesi oluşturmanın doğru yolu hangi kod parçacığıdır?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(type, health) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".type = type;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health = health;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>new Enemy(\"Slime\", 20);</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>Enemy(\"Slime\", 20);</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>new Enemy(\"Slime\", 20);</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 149907,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>this</code> kullanarak <code>health</code> adlı yeni bir nesne özelliği oluştur. Ona <code>health</code> parametresinin değerini ver.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"50\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"58\" /><option startIndex=\"59\" endIndex=\"65\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(type, health) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health = health;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".type = type;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>this</code>, ardından <code>.</code> ve sonra <code>health</code>, <code>=</code>, <code>health</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 149908,
